(D4 — Discrepancy 4 repro: a number flag given a value past i64 sets the
 error flag AND leaves a wrapped value behind:
 99999999999999999999 - 5 * 2^64 = 7766279631452241919. A program that
 does not wrap the read in `On error` — which is every program the
 manual's own examples show — silently computes with that number.
